@inherits LayoutComponentBase

@* Its own, deliberately minimalistic layout WITHOUT sidebar/navigation for publicly (no
   login required) reachable pages such as /shared/{token} (SharedProgress.razor) - MainLayout
   would show the full app navigation (calendar, focus, notes, planner, setup, ...) and thereby
   suggest the anonymous viewer has access to more than the shared snapshot. Deliberately no
   State injection here: the page needs nothing beyond its own fetched data. The one exception is
   the footer with the privacy policy and imprint (audit 2026-11-19 S3): anyone who opens a link
   without an account has to be able to see who is behind the instance, so every page in this
   layout carries them. PrivacyPolicyNote reads the operator's Legal:* settings from the anonymous
   GET api/instance and labels the publisher's imprint as such when the operator set none. *@
<div class="public-shell" tabindex="-1">
    @Body
    <footer class="public-legal">
        <PrivacyPolicyNote />
    </footer>
</div>
